==History==
2022
*The Phoenix [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 26/10/2022, in the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 2/11/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (2/11/2022)|maintenance break]], decreased the Phoenix's damage by 10% {{Balance|Nerf}}, and increased the Phoenix Egg's lifetime to 4.3 seconds (from 4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}. It also fixed the Phoenix's sound effects {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 21/11/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (21/11/2022)|maintenance break]], decreased the Phoenix Egg's hitpoints by 34% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 7/12/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Phoenix's hitpoints by 13% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2023
*On 7/2/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/2/2023)|Balance Update]], made it so that a reborn Phoenix would only spawn with 80% of the original Phoenix's hitpoints and damage {{Balance|Neutral}}. The reborn Phoenix's would also look slightly smaller {{Balance|Neutral}}. The update also changed its description. Previously, it read "''This mystical creature will be reborn as an egg when destroyed. If it hatches, it returns to the fight! What an egg-cellent ability. Phoenix also has a fiery personality! Just kidding, it's a very serious bird. It would disapprove of all these puns.''" {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 27/3/2023, the [[Version History#Losers%20Update%20(27/3/2023)|Losers Update]], changed the Phoenix's description, replacing the word "''Pheonix''" with "''Phoenix''" {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Phoenix's death damage by 10% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Phoenix's attack time interval to 1 second (from 0.9 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Phoenix Egg's hitpoints by 0.41% {{Balance|Buff}}. It also fixed a bug where Phoenix Egg would not spawn after being buffed by [[Royal Chef]] {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] removed the Phoenix's Crown Tower damage reduction {{Balance|Remove}}.
*On 3/11/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], made it so a reborn Phoenix would spawn with 100% of the original Phoenix’s hitpoints and damage (instead of 80%). The reborn Phoenix would also be the same size as the original. 
2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Phoenix Egg's hitpoints by 32%, and increased the Egg's lifetime to 4.3 seconds (from 3.8 seconds).

